            "title": "Returns, exchanges and refunds",
            "nav_label": "Returns and refunds"
          }
        },
        "q-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I start a return?",
            "text": "<p>Email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@stilhusetnord.dk\">support@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with your order number and the item you want to send back, within 14 days of receiving it. We reply with the return address and short instructions.</p><p>Please wait for that reply before posting anything &mdash; parcels sent back on their own often reach a warehouse that cannot process them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What can I return?",
            "text": "<p>Anything unworn and unwashed, in original condition with the tags still attached, within 14 days of delivery.</p><p>For hygiene reasons we cannot take back pierced jewellery once the seal is broken. Faulty items are handled separately, see below.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "It doesn't fit. Can I swap the size?",
            "text": "<p>We do not swap sizes directly. Send the item back for a refund and place a new order in the size you want, so the size is not sold to someone else while your parcel is in transit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who pays for return postage?",
            "text": "<p>You do, unless the item arrived faulty, damaged, or was not what you ordered &mdash; then we cover it.</p><p>Use a tracked service. Until the parcel reaches us, it is still your responsibility.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do returns go?",
            "text": "<p>To the address we send you when you open the return &mdash; not to the sender address printed on the parcel. Those are usually warehouses that cannot handle returns, and parcels sent there are hard to recover.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My item arrived damaged or wrong. What now?",
            "text": "<p>Email <a href=\"mailto:support@stilhusetnord.dk\">support@stilhusetnord.dk</a> within 14 days of delivery with your order number and photos. We send a replacement or refund you, and we pay the return postage.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why do you need photos?",
            "text": "<p>They usually let us settle the case straight away, without you posting anything back. They are also what we pass on when we file the claim with the supplier or the carrier.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long do refunds take?",
            "text": "<p>We issue the refund within 14 days of receiving your return. Your bank or card provider then needs another 3&ndash;5 working days before it shows on your statement.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will I get my money back?",
            "text": "<p>Yes &mdash; to the original payment method, for the full price of the returned items. If you return a complete order, the standard delivery charge you paid is refunded too.</p>"
          }
        },
        "group-11": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery and tracking",
            "nav_label": "Delivery and tracking"
          }
        },
        "q-12": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does delivery take?",
            "text": "<p>We prepare and dispatch orders within 1&ndash;3 working days. Delivery takes [ADD: your typical delivery window] on top of that.</p><p>Orders placed at the weekend or on a public holiday start processing the next working day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-13": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where's my tracking number?",
            "text": "<p>It is emailed as soon as your parcel is dispatched, so it does not exist yet while the order is still being prepared. You can also follow it on our <a href=\"/pages/track-order\">Track my order</a> page.</p><p>If you cannot find the email, check your spam folder before getting in touch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-14": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My order is late. What should I do?",
            "text": "<p>Tracking sometimes goes quiet for a few days while a parcel moves between carriers. On its own, that does not mean it is lost.</p><p>If nothing has moved for 7 days, or the estimated date has passed, email <a href=\"mailto:support@stilhusetnord.dk\">support@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with your order number and we will chase it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-15": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Only part of my order arrived. Why?",
            "text": "<p>Items are not always stored in the same place, so an order can leave in several parcels with separate tracking numbers. The rest is on its way and you are not charged extra for it.</p><p>If the remaining parcel has not arrived within a week of the first one, contact us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-16": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tracking says delivered, but I don't have it.",
            "text": "<p>Check with the people you live with, your neighbours, and any parcel box or pickup point nearby &mdash; carriers often leave parcels there and mark them delivered.</p><p>If it still has not turned up, contact us within 7 days of the delivery scan, while the carrier still holds the records.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-17": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer express delivery?",
            "text": "<p>[ADD: yes or no, and what it costs. If you do not offer it, say so plainly here.]</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-18": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you deliver, and will I pay customs?",
            "text": "<p>[ADD: the countries you ship to.]</p><p>[ADD: whether duties and import VAT are included at checkout or paid on arrival. This is the answer customers complain about most when it is missing, so be precise.]</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-19": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which carriers do you use?",
            "text": "<p>[ADD: the carriers that actually deliver your parcels, for example PostNord, GLS or DHL.] The carrier is named in your tracking email.</p>"
          }
        },
        "group-20": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Orders and changes",
            "nav_label": "Orders and changes"
          }
        },
        "q-21": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I cancel my order?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, as long as it has not been dispatched. Email <a href=\"mailto:support@stilhusetnord.dk\">support@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with your order number as soon as you can &mdash; there is a short window before the order goes to the warehouse.</p><p>Once it has shipped, the quickest route is to accept delivery and return it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-22": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I change my delivery address?",
            "text": "<p>Only before dispatch. Send us the corrected address with your order number straight away and we will update it if the order has not left yet.</p><p>Carriers cannot redirect a parcel once it is in their network.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-23": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I ordered something by mistake. Can you remove it?",
            "text": "<p>If the order has not been dispatched, yes &mdash; tell us which item and we remove it and refund that part. After dispatch it has to go through the normal return.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-24": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will a sold out size come back?",
            "text": "<p>Sometimes, but we cannot promise it &mdash; stock depends on what our suppliers can produce. We do not run back-in-stock alerts at the moment, so the newsletter is the best way to hear when a range returns.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-25": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I paid but got no confirmation email.",
            "text": "<p>Check your spam folder first, then the address you typed at checkout &mdash; a single wrong character is the usual cause.</p><p>If it is still missing, email <a href=\"mailto:support@stilhusetnord.dk\">support@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with the name and address you ordered under and we will resend it. A missing email does not mean the order failed.</p>"
          }
        },
